  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This transaction consists of an uncommitted revolving reverse factoring facility(the &quot;Factoring Facility&quot;) in favor of Grupo Fonder&#xED;a S.A. de C.V. (&#x201C;Fonder&#xED;a&#x201D; or the &#x201C;Company&#x201D;), for discounting or monetizing credit rights arising from the sale of goods and or services from suppliers to the Company. Fonder&#xED;a is a group engaged in the manufacture of steel products from recycled scrap. The Company has four production plants, all located in the SLP industrial zone, in Mexico.</narrative>
  </description>
